      "comment": "CELSIUS (2) looks close to another win after finishing second last time (18.11) in a Grade 5 at this track. Sure to be about the mark. BAGOT BULLET (8) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing 11 from 19 starts. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when third (18.43) at this track. Has a win and two minor placings from three starts from this draw. Expected to feature again. CHEERS MICK (4) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 3 lengths at this track in a handy 18.21 beating Sportster. Deserves serious consideration again. TERRITORY LIFE (1) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
